---
import GeneratedInkArtwork from '../GeneratedInkArtwork.astro';
import NetworkFlowGeometry from '../NetworkFlowGeometry.astro';
import '../../styles/digital-commons.css';
---
<section id="meios-digitais" class="section digital-commons narrative-section" data-number="3" aria-labelledby="digital-commons-title" data-narrative="network">
  <div class="network-stage narrative-stage">
    <div class="network-meta narrative-meta"><div class="section-label"><span>03</span><span>Meios digitais · poder popular</span></div><span data-network-counter aria-hidden="true">01 / 03</span></div>
    <h2 id="digital-commons-title">O mundo digital<br /><em>também é território de luta.</em></h2>
    <figure class="network-art landing-ink-figure narrative-art">
      <div class="network-plates">
        <div class="network-plate" data-network-plate="capture"><span class="network-plate-label">Concentração e dependência.</span><GeneratedInkArtwork scene="network"><NetworkFlowGeometry mode="capture" /></GeneratedInkArtwork></div>
        <div class="network-plate" data-network-plate="response"><span class="network-plate-label">Meios próprios, capacidade compartilhada.</span><GeneratedInkArtwork scene="network-solution"><NetworkFlowGeometry mode="response" /></GeneratedInkArtwork></div>
      </div>
      <figcaption class="scene-narration">
        <p data-narration-step>Nosso trabalho gera valor.</p>
        <p data-narration-step>As plataformas capturam dados e atenção.</p>
        <p data-narration-step>Construir nossos próprios meios.</p>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <footer class="network-footer narrative-footer"><a href="/caderno/meios-digitais-poder-popular/">Disputar os meios digitais · Caderno</a><span class="network-progress narrative-meter" aria-hidden="true"><i data-network-meter></i></span></footer>
  </div>
</section>
